oop.com/p/let-tyrese-maxey-lead?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5973&amp;post_id=208762406&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Let Tyrese Maxey lead: The LeBron experiment threatens a beautiful thing</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏒▶️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lf7wxGjKYLI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Worst Goalie Starts in NHL History</a></strong> by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PinholesGraham\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pinholes Graham Hockey</a></p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://blessyourchart.substack.com/p/192-the-shape-of-the-college-football?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1185822&amp;post_id=209012326&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>The shape of the college football season</span></a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://thespade.substack.com/p/analyzing-all-77-nfl-rule-book-changes?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1892935&amp;post_id=208864207&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Analyzing all 77 NFL Rule Book Changes for the 2026 Season</span></a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://gridirondeepdive.substack.com/p/the-nfls-most-valuable-returners?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1522762&amp;post_id=188926741&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>The NFL's Most Valuable Returners of 2025</span></a><span> by </span></strong> </p></li>\n<li><p>🎓 <strong><a href=\"https://www.extrapointsmb.com/p/economic-impact-modeling-college-sports?utm_source=www.extrapointsmb.com&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=how-much-is-a-fan-worth-to-your-program&amp;_bhlid=8374f3aea1777f9d29ed882af1b1f9973ceb861f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>How much is a fan worth to your program?</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏁▶️ </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6aEJwI0X75Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>F1 drivers have become hostages to AI</span></a> </strong>by THE RACE</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏁▶️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_PTkP6Sf2go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASCAR Timeline: Jeff Gordon vs. Rusty Wallace</a></strong> by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@NASCARClassics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASCAR Classics</a></p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏁</span><strong><a href=\"https://nascar.substack.com/p/where-weve-seen-shades-of-hocevar?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=6037807&amp;post_id=208870546&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span> Where we’ve seen shades of Hocevar-Heim rivalry in other sports — and what could come next</span></a><span> by </span></strong> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏁 </span><a href=\"https://motorsportsbeat.substack.com/p/sweet-home-chicago-or-perhaps-not?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1004156&amp;post_id=209094032&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Sweet Home Chicago... Or Perhaps Not: Both NASCAR and the Chicago Bears may both be competing outside of Chicago proper in future seasons.</span></a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏁 </span><strong><a href=\"https://f1chronicle.substack.com/p/what-does-the-fia-do-in-f1-the-governing?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2611220&amp;post_id=209080521&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>What Does The FIA Do In F1? The Governing Body Explained</span></a></strong><span> and </span><strong><a href=\"https://f1chronicle.substack.com/p/verstappens-hungarian-gp-gamble-should?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2611220&amp;post_id=208804548&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Verstappen’s Hungarian GP Gamble Should Not Have Worked. The Data Shows Why It Did</a> </strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏁▶️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-oCw53U6Ugs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The NASCAR Shorter Races Debate</a> </strong>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TheIceberg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Iceberg</a></p></li>\n<li><p><span>✏️ </span><strong><a href=\"https://sportsmediaguy.substack.com/p/a-lack-of-journalism-training-is?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5996&amp;post_id=208832005&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>A lack of journalism training is not a badge of honor</span></a></strong><span> by </span></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>👀▶️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYNyHEeFYxw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Secret Gov Plot to SAVE THEMSELVES In Societal Collapse</a> </strong>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@breakingpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Breaking Points</a></p></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>▶️ <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/my-old-games-lists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Old YouTube Game(s)</a> of the Week</h4>\n<p>Rangers at Red Sox - June 20, 1999 (SP - Pedro Martinez)</p>\n<h4>🎵 Music to Play Us Out</h4>\n<p>Lewis OfMan - Highway (feat. Empress Of)</p>\n<p><em><strong>Filed under:</strong></em> <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Weekly Round-up</a></p>\n<p>Neil’s Substack is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber.</p>",
